<title>MALAYSIA: RJ Reynolds 1996 net at 114 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>RJ Reynolds 1996 net at 114 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    114.21	 vs	  93.32</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	    44.0	  vs	  36.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			604.19	 vs	 569.92</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		141.84	 vs	 133.74</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	    24.0	  vs	  22.0</p>
<p>NOTE - R.J Reynolds Bhd is involved in the manufacture and sale of tobacco products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
